WEBVTT

00:05:30.576 --> 00:05:33.579
I could go out and get buckets
like Cynthia Cooper.

00:05:33.621 --> 00:05:36.540
(Applause)

00:05:36.665 --> 00:05:38.501
You see, my parents encouraged sports

00:05:38.542 --> 00:05:41.462
because sports in their eyes
was a microcosm of life.

00:05:41.504 --> 00:05:43.047
You learn to win.

00:05:43.089 --> 00:05:44.340
You learn to lose.

00:05:44.965 --> 00:05:46.717
You learn to work through obstacles.

00:05:46.759 --> 00:05:48.803
You learn to get up
when you don't want to.

00:05:48.844 --> 00:05:52.306
You learn to value differences,
because those are important.

00:05:53.391 --> 00:05:56.602
But as I ventured out
into the world, I realized, like,

00:05:56.602 --> 00:06:00.064
the world wasn't so uplifting
towards differences, right?